      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Threw something together using OSC: https://github.com/kitlith/one-hand-osc\n\nAside from it being in a state of \"quick-n-dirty PoC\" that I'd want to polish up before reccomending it for anyone else's use, it has some limitations caused by not being a native implementation. For instance, it bypasses the movement lock that's normally present when you open your radial menu.",
